  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Independent, representative, effective and sustainable employer and business membership organizations have a critical role to play in labour market governance. This biennium the ILO has continued to support the Marshall Islands Chamber of Commerce and Industry (MICCI) to strengthen its institutional and organizational capacities. Notable initiatives include technical assistance and support for analysis of the changing business environment and associated advocacy for reforms to immigration regulations, workers compensation and the need to establish a national tripartite body for social dialoue; and support for the development and deployment of customized membership management software.</narrative>
  </description>
